--- !u!114 &836339772
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 836339771}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2507da4064fa6cb42801933777c38ad7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.LandVoice
  defence: {fileID: 295387072}
  fires:
  - {fileID: 737374720}
  - {fileID: 103874667}
  - {fileID: 961295926}
  - {fileID: 687078889}
  - {fileID: 2010621221}
  fireWords:
  - 'Light it.

    Fire answers anyone who asks. That is how he began.

    I can reach you at a fire. Nowhere else, in this light.'
  - 'They drank the river and are thirsty still.

    He told them the sun would be enough.'
  - 'Take the spear. Its owner is done with it.

    He carries one like it. His is better. It will be yours.'
  - 'Every face on this road is his.

    A man who cannot bear to see another''s.'
  - 'Past the gate is his court. He will tell you he carried it home for them.

    Look at them. Then listen to him.'
  Waking:
  - You are awake. Good.
  - You do not know your name. I took it, with everything behind it. That was the price of pulling you out.
  - This is the sun-king's country. There was a river here.
  - A man found fire lying in the desert and named himself the sun. No god ruled here before him. He is the first, and he is a thief.
  - I have nothing to lend you. Your hands will do. What you need, he has.
  - If you fall I will turn the hours back. Not far. To the last fire you lit.
  AfterAFall:
  - You fell. I turned it back as far as the fire.
  - They are standing again. So are you.
  WakingKey: suncity.woke
  SpeaksAfter: 2.5
